// Minimal v1.0 compile-time stubs for the 19 flagged-off Coax page modules
// (docs/desktop/openagents-v1-spec.md §4.4, §5.6).
//
// Loaded only by page-v1.coax / app-v1.coax for --minimal release builds so
// carrier.c and host.c link with zero changes while omitting ~13,868 LOC of
// excluded panel UI code from gallery.o. Full developer builds continue to load
// app.coax / page.coax with every module intact.

